# Same shared Supabase project as mosaro/RecipeBot -- copy the URL and
# ANON key from mosaro/.env.local. Deliberately no service-role key here
# at all: this app is public and read-only, and not having the key
# available in this codebase is the strongest guarantee it never gets
# used server-side by accident. All data access relies on the RLS
# policies in mosaro/supabase/schema.sql's "Public read-only RLS for the
# Food Index tables" section.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
